    Bug 707165 - Improve 'account' column for messages with account key. r=mkmelin


    Messages originally received by a Thunderbird POP3 account contain an
    'X-Account-Key:' header. If an account for this key can't be found, or if it
    currently maps to a typeless incoming server such as 'Local Folders' or 'Unified
    Folders', display the verbose account key instead of the pretty name for the
    incoming server.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D270084

